<title>JAPAN: Japan April crude oil import statistics.</title>
<headline>Japan April crude oil import statistics.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's Ministry of International Trade and Industry (MITI) issued the following data on crude oil imports for April 1997:</p>
<p> CRUDE OIL   (1,000 kl) (1,000 bbl) mth/mth% yr/yr%</p>
<p> Iran	   1,453	  9,139    -56.2    -33.0</p>
<p> Saudi Arabia 5,261	 33,092     -1.1    +42.1</p>
<p> Kuwait	 1,534	  7,737    +12.2    +55.4</p>
<p> Neutral Zone 1,170	  9,649     -5.8     -6.2</p>
<p> Qatar	  1,514	  9,523     -7.2     +6.2</p>
<p> Oman	     944	  5,938     +2.0    -16.0</p>
<p> UAE	    6,477	 40,740     +7.7     -0.5</p>
<p> Yemen	   ---	   ---	 ---	---</p>
<p> China	  1,206	  7,586    +16.3    +26.4</p>
<p> Malaysia	 344	  2,164    -22.5    +11.6</p>
<p> Brunei	   114	    717    -55.8    -44.5</p>
<p> Indonesia    1,289	  8,108    -37.5    -24.4</p>
<p> Vietnam	  413	  2,598    -22.3    +89.4</p>
<p> Mexico	   562	  3,535   +254.0   +114.9</p>
<p> Thailand	  64	    403     ---	---</p>
<p> Australia	203	  1,277   +374.2   +116.3</p>
<p> TOTAL	 22,839	143,657     -7.1     +6.9</p>
